        "published_at": "2022-11-17",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Mr. McInerney, 47, has served as President of the Company since 2013. Prior to joining the Company, Mr. McInerney served as Chief Executive Officer of Consumer Banking for JPMorgan Chase, a global financial services firm, from June 2010 to May 2013, and prior to that time as Chief Operating Officer for Home Lending and Chief Risk Officer for JPMorgan Chase’s consumer businesses.",
