        "published_at": "2022-11-17",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "On November 17, 2022, Visa Inc. (the “Company”) announced that the Company’s Board of Directors had unanimously elected Ryan McInerney to succeed Alfred F. Kelly, Jr. as the Company’s Chief Executive Officer, effective February 1, 2023.",
