        "published_at": "2023-02-01",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "On January 30, 2023, the board of directors (the \"Board\") of Visa Inc. (the \"Company\"), upon the recommendation of the Board's Nominating and Corporate Governance Committee, approved an increase in the size of the Board from 10 to 11 members and the appointment of Ryan McInerney to the Board, effective February 1, 2023, for a term that will expire at the Company's 2024 Annual Meeting of Stockholders.",
        "tier": 1
